1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,325
Counting 11 to 20 with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,625 --> 00:00:11,716
Mimo: Hi friends! We already know how to count to ten. Today, let's count all the way to twenty!

3
00:00:12,016 --> 00:00:13,756
Bruno: Twenty? That's a lot of numbers!

4
00:00:14,056 --> 00:00:20,630
Mimo: We'll count balloons for a big party! Here are the first ten. Let's count them fast!

5
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:29,375
Mimo: One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten!

6
00:00:29,675 --> 00:00:33,946
Mimo: Ten balloons! Now let's keep counting. Ready?

7
00:00:34,246 --> 00:00:35,261
Mimo: Eleven!

8
00:00:35,961 --> 00:00:36,695
Bruno: Twelve!

9
00:00:37,395 --> 00:00:38,433
Mimo: Thirteen!

10
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:39,947
Bruno: Fourteen!

11
00:00:40,647 --> 00:00:41,777
Mimo: Fifteen!

12
00:00:42,477 --> 00:00:50,560
Mimo: Fifteen balloons! Let's take a little break. Can you show me fifteen? That's ten fingers and five more!

13
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:54,715
Bruno: I'm going to hold one balloon. Just one!

14
00:00:57,015 --> 00:00:58,663
Bruno: Whoa! The balloon is taking me up!

15
00:01:03,585 --> 00:01:06,339
Pip: Can I help count? I love balloons!

16
00:01:06,639 --> 00:01:07,741
Pip: Sixteen!

17
00:01:08,441 --> 00:01:09,679
Mimo: Seventeen!

18
00:01:10,379 --> 00:01:11,241
Pip: Eighteen!

19
00:01:11,941 --> 00:01:13,064
Mimo: Nineteen!

20
00:01:13,764 --> 00:01:14,486
Pip: Twenty!

21
00:01:15,186 --> 00:01:17,776
Mimo: Twenty balloons! We did it!

22
00:01:19,376 --> 00:01:24,793
Mimo: Now let's count from eleven to twenty one more time, all together! Ready?

23
00:01:25,093 --> 00:01:26,107
Mimo: Eleven!

24
00:01:26,607 --> 00:01:27,341
Pip: Twelve!

25
00:01:27,841 --> 00:01:28,703
Bruno: Thirteen!

26
00:01:29,203 --> 00:01:30,235
Mimo: Fourteen!

27
00:01:30,735 --> 00:01:31,713
Pip: Fifteen!

28
00:01:32,213 --> 00:01:33,212
Bruno: Sixteen!

29
00:01:33,712 --> 00:01:34,949
Mimo: Seventeen!

30
00:01:35,449 --> 00:01:36,311
Pip: Eighteen!

31
00:01:36,811 --> 00:01:37,696
Bruno: Nineteen!

32
00:01:38,196 --> 00:01:39,029
Mimo: Twenty!

33
00:01:39,529 --> 00:01:43,328
Mimo: Great counting, friends! You can count to twenty!

34
00:01:43,628 --> 00:01:46,034
Bruno: Now can we pop them? Pop, pop, pop!

35
00:01:48,334 --> 00:01:51,789
Mimo: Bye bye, friends! See you next time!
